  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>샤<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>짇ᄃᆤ<span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>과<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>샤<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> 냐<ruby>냐<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dKNZlWsV3YI?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>先<rt>솅ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>放<rt>방ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>鬆<rt>상ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>飲<rt>림ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一點<rt>짇댬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>茫<rt>빵ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siēng-pàng-hor-sâng līm-jit-tiâm-â-jiù lai-báng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>相仝<rt>쇼ˉ강ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>多情<rt>도ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    làn lông-siō-kāng, si-tō-jiéng’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>疼心<rt>턀ˋ심ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>故事<rt>거ˋ수ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>少年人<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thià̰-sîm’e kòr-sū, siàu-lien-láng lông-ū\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>勇敢<rt>영ˆ감ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>大欉<rt>돠장ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-jit-kâng làn e-kôh-khâh-yông-kâm-toa-jáng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繼續<rt>게ˋ셕-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>認同<rt>띤덩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>美夢<rt>삐ˆ빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kè-siork-lai-phâh-pià̰-lân-rin-tóng’e bî-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>其實<rt>기싣-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>知<rt>재ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>勉強<rt>뼨ˆ경ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ki-sit-goà jâi, rin-siêng si-biên-kiông-boe-lái\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>情<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>大海<rt>돠해ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>小船<rt>쇼ˆ준ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>按怎<rt>안ˆ좔ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>駛<rt>새ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiéng na-toa-hài, siô-jún ân-joâ̰-sài\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>做伴<rt>죄ˋ퐐ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>燒<rt>쇼ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>寒<rt>괄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-lì lai-joè-phoā̰, goà m-kiā̰-siō-koá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>戲<rt>히</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>曉<rt>ᄒᆤˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>搬<rt>봘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-bo-lî-jît-chût-hi, goà boe-hiâu-poâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>真心<rt>진ˉ심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>鬥陣<rt>ᄃᅷˋ딘ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>其他<rt>기탈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jīn-sîm lai-tàu-tīn, ki-thâ̰ lông-bo-sǹg-sià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>留<rt>ᄅᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>情份<rt>졩훈ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>通<rt>탕ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>焦<rt>다ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lau-jieng-hūn tio-m-thāng-hor-tâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一條<rt>짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>歌<rt>과ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>爾<rt>냐-</rt></ruby><ruby>爾<rt>냐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ-jit-tiau-koâ, siâ-lî-goà nia-niā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>헤<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>屬於<rt>셕의-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>一生<rt>읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>深<rt>침ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>痕跡<rt>훈떃</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hê-siork-i-lân-ît-siêng siong-chîm’e hun-riah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一條<rt>짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌<rt>과ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>所<rt>서ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>조</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>紀念<rt>기ˋ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-tiau-koâ wi-làn sôr-jo’e kì-liām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>慢慢<rt>빤빤-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>唱<rt>츌</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>慢慢<rt>빤빤-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ban-ban-â-chiṵ, kôh-ban-ban-â-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一條<rt>짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>歌<rt>과ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>爾<rt>냐-</rt></ruby><ruby>爾<rt>냐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ-jit-tiau-koâ, siâ-lî-goà nia-niā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>헤<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>屬於<rt>셕의-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>一生<rt>읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>鬥陣<rt>ᄃᅷˋ딘ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>背影<rt>붸얄ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hê-siork-i-lân-ît-siêng tàu-tīn’e pue-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一條<rt>짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌<rt>과ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>和<rt>함-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>胛脊<rt>갛ˆ쟣</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-tiau-koâ u-lì ham-goà’e kâh-jiah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>順順<rt>순순-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>唱<rt>츌</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>順順<rt>순순-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sun-sun-â-chiṵ, kôh-jò-huè sun-sun-â-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>世間<rt>세ˋ간ˆ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>戲弄<rt>히ˋ랑ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>放<rt>방ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>闊<rt>쾋</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sè-kân hì-lāng, sīm-jiéng ài-pàng-hor-khoah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>飄撇<rt>ᄑᆤˉ폗</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𠢕<rt>ᄁᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>孤單<rt>거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà lông-jāi-yà̰ phiāu-phiet’e láng gau-kōr-toâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>難免<rt>란뼨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>鬱卒<rt>욷ˆ줃</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lan-biên-e-ût-jut\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>總<rt>정ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>憂愁<rt>유ˉ츄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jòng si-e-yū-chiú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>做陣<rt>죄ˋ딘ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>怨尤<rt>완ˋ유ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-lì lai-joè-tīn tio-lông-bo-oàn-yú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>兄弟<rt>햘ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>相伨<rt>쇼ˉ틴ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>免<rt>뼨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>理由<rt>리ˆ유ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hiā̰-tī lai-siō-thīn tio-m-biên-lî-yú\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一條<rt>짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>歌<rt>과ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>爾<rt>냐-</rt></ruby><ruby>爾<rt>냐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ-jit-tiau-koâ, siâ-lî-goà nia-niā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>헤<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>屬於<rt>셕의-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>一生<rt>읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>深<rt>침ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>痕跡<rt>훈떃</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hê-siork-i-lân-ît-siêng siong-chîm’e hun-riah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一條<rt>짇ᄃᆤ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌<rt>과ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>所<rt>서ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>조</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>紀念<rt>기ˋ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-tiau-koâ wi-làn sôr-jo’e kì-liām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>慢慢<rt>빤빤-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>唱<rt>츌</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>慢慢<rt>빤빤-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ban-ban-â-chiṵ, kôh-ban-ban-â-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一條<